  <metadata>
    <id>unirate-cli</id>
    <version>0.1.0</version>
    <title>UniRate CLI</title>
    <authors>UniRate API</authors>
    <owners>unirateapi</owners>
    <summary>Currency exchange rates, conversion, and VAT lookups from the UniRate API, straight from your terminal.</summary>
    <description>
The **UniRate CLI** (`unirate`) brings currency exchange rates, conversion, and
VAT lookups from the [UniRate API](https://unirateapi.com) to your terminal.

```
unirate convert 100 USD EUR
unirate rate USD JPY
unirate rates EUR --json
unirate currencies
unirate vat DE
```

- Real-time rates between 170+ currencies (fiat + crypto)
- Currency conversion, all-rates tables, and supported-currency listing
- VAT rates for countries worldwide
- Historical rates + time series (Pro)
- `--json` on every command for clean piping into `jq`
- A single static binary with **zero third-party runtime dependencies**

The API key is read from the `UNIRATE_API_KEY` environment variable or the
`--api-key` flag. Get a free key (no credit card) at https://unirateapi.com.

## Package notes

This package downloads the official, checksum-pinned release binary published
by the UniRate team on GitHub. See `tools\VERIFICATION.txt` for how to verify
it matches upstream.
    </description>
